city-0 motion-safe:transition-opacity group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:opacity-100 group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:opacity-100 has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:opacity-100" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="메시지 복사" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-bc53276c.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="메시지 편집" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-bc53276c.svg#6d87e1" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button></div></div></div></div><span class="sr-only"><br></span></section></div><div class="" data-turn-id-container="07490267-3943-4f06-959b-afcec8c89836" data-is-intersecting="true"><section class="text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]" dir="auto" data-turn-id="07490267-3943-4f06-959b-afcec8c89836" data-turn-id-container="07490267-3943-4f06-959b-afcec8c89836" data-testid="conversation-turn-52" data-scroll-anchor="false" data-turn="assistant"><h4 class="sr-only select-none">ChatGPT의 말:</h4><div class="text-base my-auto mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)"><div class="[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><button type="button" class="text-token-text-tertiary hover:text-token-text-primary dark:hover:text-token-text-primary flex items-center gap-0.5 text-start dark:text-(--interactive-label-tertiary-default)">Thought for 8m 55s<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="icon-xs"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-bc53276c.svg#b140e7" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="94880f94-df41-4ca4-baad-1b8bc2965ef9" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-4-thinking" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="17">맞아요. 원인은 두 가지였어요.</p>
<p data-start="19" data-end="181">첫째, <strong data-start="23" data-end="66">기존 포스터 안에 이미 3칸 QR 박스가 baked-in 되어 있었는데</strong>, 그 위에 새 4칸 박스를 덮는 방식으로 작업되면서 아래쪽/옆쪽에 원래 박스 흔적이 남았습니다.<br data-start="120" data-end="123">
둘째, 일부 버전은 <strong data-start="134" data-end="167">생성 이미지나 리사이즈 과정에서 QR가 부드럽게 처리</strong>돼서 스캔성이 떨어졌어요.</p>
<p data-start="183" data-end="190">그래서 이번엔</p>
<ul data-start="191" data-end="302">
<li data-section-id="1izqr8v" data-start="191" data-end="229">
<p data-start="193" data-end="229">기존 QR 박스 영역을 <strong data-start="206" data-end="229">같은 하단 패널 텍스처로 먼저 정리</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="zluylr" data-start="230" data-end="262">
<p data-start="232" data-end="262"><strong data-start="232" data-end="256">사용자가 방금 올린 원본 QR 4개만</strong> 다시 삽입</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="yw4juh" data-start="263" data-end="292">
<p data-start="265" data-end="292">QR는 흐려지지 않게 <strong data-start="277" data-end="292">선명한 방식으로 축소</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1sa9tns" data-start="293" data-end="302">
<p data-start="295" data-end="302">PNG로 저장</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="304" data-end="317">해서 다시 만들었습니다.</p>
<p data-start="319" data-end="399">수정본:<br>
<span class="" data-state="closed"><button class="behavior-btn hover:entity-accent focus-visible:focus-ring entity-underline inline cursor-pointer appearance-none border-0 bg-transparent p-0 text-start align-baseline text-inherit" type="button">깔끔하게 다시 정리한 버전</button></span></p>
<p data-start="401" data-end="487" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">참고로 채팅창 미리보기는 앱/브라우저에서 약간 압축돼 보일 수 있어서, <strong data-start="441" data-end="471">실제 스캔 테스트는 다운로드한 PNG 파일 기준</strong>으로 보는 게 더 정확합니다.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="응답 작업" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="응답 복사" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-bc53276c.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="좋은 응답" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="good-response-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-bc53276c.svg#51753c" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="별로인 응답" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="bad-response-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-bc53276c.svg#2126ae" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="공유하기" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-bc53276c.svg#630ca2" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button><span class="" data-state="closed"><button type="button" id="radix-_r_jb_" aria-haspopup="menu" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" class="cursor-pointer touch:px-2.5 text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary h-[30px] rounded-md px-1.5" aria-label="모델 바꾸기"><div class="flex items-center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-bc53276c.svg#ec66f0" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></div></button></span><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary touch:w-10 flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg" aria-label="더 많은 액션" type="button" id="radix-_r_8m_" aria-haspopup="menu" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-bc53276c.svg#f6d0e2" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div></div></div></div><span class="sr-only"><br></span></section></div><div class="h-(--last-known-height,50vh) min-h-14" data-turn-id-container="01959f16-d63c-437b-b4ee-1a6810d42791" data-is-intersecting="false"><section class="text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-(--header-height)" dir="auto" data-turn-id="01959f16-d63c-437b-b4ee-1a6810d42791" data-turn-id-container="01959f16-d63c-437b-b4ee-1a6810d42791" data-testid="conversation-turn-53" data-scroll-anchor="false" data-turn="user"></section></div><div class="" data-turn-id-container="e7b3a277-1eff-4355-94de-ac47fddc1c00" data-is-intersecting="true"><section class="text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]" dir="auto" data-turn-id="e7b3a277-1eff-4355-94de-ac47fddc1c00" data-turn-id-container="e7b3a277-1eff-4355-94de-ac47fddc1c00" data-testid="conversation-turn-54" data-scroll-anchor="false" data-turn="assistant"><h4 class="sr-only select-none">ChatGPT의 말:</h4><div class="text-base my-auto mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)"><div class="[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><button type="button" class="text-token-text-tertiary hover:text-token-text-primary dark:hover:text-token-text-primary flex items-center gap-0.5 text-start dark:text-(--interactive-label-tertiary-default)">Thought for 1m 53s<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="icon-xs"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-bc53276c.svg#b140e7" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="c82dec36-8f67-49d5-9c54-f04bea5d01f1" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-4-thinking" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="51">맞아요. 문제는 제가 이전에 <strong data-start="16" data-end="42">기존 하단 패널 위에 계속 덧씌우는 방식</strong>으로 수정하면서,</p>
<ul data-start="52" data-end="136">
<li data-section-id="15obdkl" data-start="52" data-end="72">
<p data-start="54" data-end="72">아래 박스가 미묘하게 밀려 보이고</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="12x2az3" data-start="73" data-end="96">
<p data-start="75" data-end="96">텍스트 영역과 QR 영역 균형이 깨지고</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1evn3u" data-start="97" data-end="136">
<p data-start="99" data-end="136">QR도 일부 버전에서 축소/재처리되며 인식성이 떨어진 점이었습니다.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="138" data-end="216">그래서 이번에는 <strong data-start="147" data-end="174">하단 패널 전체를 새로 깨끗하게 다시 잡고</strong>,<br data-start="175" data-end="178">
<strong data-start="178" data-end="201">방금 주신 원본 QR 4개만 그대로</strong> 넣어서 다시 정리했습니다.</p>
<p data-start="218" data-end="295">수정본:<br>
<span class="" data-state="closed"><button class="behavior-btn hover:entity-accent focus-visible:focus-ring entity-underline inline cursor-pointer appearance-none border-0 bg-transparent p-0 text-start align-baseline text-inherit" type="button">균형 다시 맞춘 버전</button></span></p>
<p data-start="297" data-end="312">이번 버전에서 집중한 부분:</p>
<ul data-start="313" data-end="403">
<li data-section-id="az6n9o" data-start="313" data-end="332">
<p data-start="315" data-end="332">아래 큰 박스를 깔끔하게 재구성</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="14tk9rr" data-start="333" data-end="357">
<p data-start="335" data-end="357">QR 박스를 오른쪽에 더 안정적으로 배치</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1psgx9w" data-start="358" data-end="378">
<p data-start="360" data-end="378">왼쪽 글씨 안 먹도록 줄바꿈 조정</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="xmiw7y" data-start="379" data-end="403">
<p data-start="381" data-end="403">QR는 원본 파일 그대로, 선명하게 유지</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="405" data-end="499" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">이 버전 보고 괜찮으면, 그다음에 바로 <strong data-start="427" data-end="449">A5 인쇄용 PDF/Word 파일</strong>로 만들어드릴게요. <span class="align-middle" data-state="closed"><button aria-label="코딩 인용" class="rounded-xl px-1 text-token-text-secondary bg-token-bg-tertiary hover:text-token-text-primary hover:bg-token-interactive-bg-secondary-selected"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-bc53276c.svg#e45ab3" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></span></p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="응답 작업" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="응답 복사" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-bc53276c.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="좋은 응답" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="good-response-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-bc53276c.svg#51753c" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="별로인 응답" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="bad-response-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-bc53276c.svg#2126ae" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="공유하기" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-bc53276c.svg#630ca2" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button><span class="" data-state="closed"><button type="button" id="radix-_r_je_" aria-haspopup="menu" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" class="cursor-pointer touch:px-2.5 text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary h-[30px] rounded-md px-1.5" aria-label="모델 바꾸기"><div class="flex items-center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-bc53276c.svg#ec66f0" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></div></button></span><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary touch:w-10 flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg" aria-label="더 많은 액션" type="button" id="radix-_r_92_" aria-haspopup="menu" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" wid