iv></div></div><div class="user-message-bubble-color corner-superellipse/0.98 relative min-w-0 overflow-hidden rounded-[22px] px-4 py-2.5 leading-6 rounded-se-lg max-w-(--user-chat-width,70%)"><div class="max-w-full min-w-0 [overflow-wrap:anywhere] whitespace-pre-wrap">좋다. 이걸 여기에서 All-in-One Package 오른쪽 공간에 넣고 싶은데 codex에 어떻게 말해야해?</div></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex justify-end"><div aria-label="내 메시지 작업" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto touch:opacity-100 duration-300 group-hover/turn-messages:delay-300 pointer-events-none opacity-0 motion-safe:transition-opacity group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:opacity-100 group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:opacity-100 has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:opacity-100" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="메시지 복사" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-bc53276c.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="메시지 편집" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-bc53276c.svg#6d87e1" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button></div></div></div></div><span class="sr-only"><br></span></section></div><div class="" data-turn-id-container="7d380512-1d35-442e-9275-4e8beb6def10" data-is-intersecting="true"><section class="text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]" dir="auto" data-turn-id="7d380512-1d35-442e-9275-4e8beb6def10" data-turn-id-container="7d380512-1d35-442e-9275-4e8beb6def10" data-testid="conversation-turn-208" data-scroll-anchor="false" data-turn="assistant"><h4 class="sr-only select-none">ChatGPT의 말:</h4><div class="text-base my-auto mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)"><div class="[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><button type="button" class="text-token-text-tertiary hover:text-token-text-primary dark:hover:text-token-text-primary flex items-center gap-0.5 text-start dark:text-(--interactive-label-tertiary-default)">20s 동안 생각함<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="icon-xs"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-bc53276c.svg#b140e7" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="da31485a-7e44-4094-8f37-cada9c731665" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-5-thinking" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="63">좋아. 먼저 내가 생성해준 이미지를 저장해서 GitHub에 올려야 해.<br data-start="39" data-end="42">
파일명은 헷갈리지 않게 이렇게 추천해.</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="65" data-end="96"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button type="button" class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="복사" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-bc53276c.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>all-in-one-hero.png</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="98" data-end="158">GitHub에는 지금까지처럼 <strong data-start="114" data-end="125">root 위치</strong>에 바로 올리면 돼.<br data-start="136" data-end="139">
즉 파일 목록에 이렇게 보이면 됨:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="160" data-end="226"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button type="button" class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="복사" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-bc53276c.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>all-in-one-hero.png</span><br><span>index.html</span><br><span>style.css</span><br><span>script.js</span><br><span>...</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="228" data-end="266">그다음 Claude Code / Codex에 아래 프롬프트를 넣어줘.</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="268" data-end="4123"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button type="button" class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="복사" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-bc53276c.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>Please update the Home page All-in-One Package hero section.</span><br><br><span>Important:</span><br><span>- Only edit the Home page All-in-One Package hero section and related CSS</span><br><span>- Do not redesign the whole website</span><br><span>- Do not modify navigation, language switcher, cart, Programs, Consultation, About, FAQ, Contact, footer, or unrelated sections</span><br><span>- Do not change All-in-One builder functionality</span><br><span>- Do not change pricing logic</span><br><span>- Do not change validation logic</span><br><span>- Keep the current premium, minimal, editorial visual style</span><br><br><span>Current issue:</span><br><span>The All-in-One Package card has too much empty space on the right side.</span><br><br><span>Goal:</span><br><span>Add a premium beauty/spa image to the right side of the All-in-One Package card.</span><br><br><span>Use this image file:</span><br><span>all-in-one-hero.png</span><br><br><span>Image direction:</span><br><span>This image shows a premium Seoul beauty/spa shop with a Han River / Namsan Tower view.</span><br><span>It should visually support the All-in-One Package as a luxury Seoul beauty experience.</span><br><br><span>TASK 1 — Add image to the right side of the All-in-One Package card</span><br><br><span>In the Home page All-in-One Package hero card, create a two-column layout on desktop.</span><br><br><span>Left column:</span><br><span>- SIGNATURE ITINERARY</span><br><span>- All-in-One Package</span><br><span>- Starting from $1,499</span><br><span>- Description</span><br><span>- Included line</span><br><span>- Build Your Journey button</span><br><br><span>Right column:</span><br><span>- Image using:</span><br><span>  all-in-one-hero.png</span><br><br><span>The image should sit inside the same large All-in-One Package card, on the right side.</span><br><br><span>TASK 2 — Image styling</span><br><br><span>Style the image so it feels premium and integrated with the current website.</span><br><br><span>Requirements:</span><br><span>- width: 100%</span><br><span>- height: 100%</span><br><span>- object-fit: cover</span><br><span>- border-radius should match the current card design</span><br><span>- image should not stretch or distort</span><br><span>- image should not overflow outside the card</span><br><span>- image should have a refined editorial crop</span><br><span>- image should align vertically with the package content</span><br><span>- keep enough spacing between text and image</span><br><br><span>Suggested CSS:</span><br><span>.all-in-one-hero {</span><br><span>  display: grid;</span><br><span>  grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.9fr) minmax(0, 1.1fr);</span><br><span>  gap: 40px;</span><br><span>  align-items: stretch;</span><br><span>}</span><br><br><span>.all-in-one-visual {</span><br><span>  min-height: 360px;</span><br><span>  border-radius: 24px;</span><br><span>  overflow: hidden;</span><br><span>}</span><br><br><span>.all-in-one-visual img {</span><br><span>  width: 100%;</span><br><span>  height: 100%;</span><br><span>  object-fit: cover;</span><br><span>  display: block;</span><br><span>}</span><br><br><span>Use class names that match the existing codebase if different.</span><br><br><span>TASK 3 — Preserve the builder</span><br><br><span>Do not remove or break the Build Your Journey button.</span><br><br><span>When the user clicks Build Your Journey:</span><br><span>- The builder should still open/reveal as it does now</span><br><span>- The selection logic should still work</span><br><span>- The total price calculation should still work</span><br><br><span>If the builder currently appears inside the same card, place it below the two-column hero content so the layout becomes:</span><br><br><span>Top:</span><br><span>[Package text] [Premium image]</span><br><br><span>Below after clicking Build Your Journey:</span><br><span>[Builder selection area]</span><br><br><span>The builder should remain full-width or balanced below the top two-column area.</span><br><br><span>TASK 4 — Mobile responsiveness</span><br><br><span>On mobile:</span><br><span>- Stack the package text first</span><br><span>- Then show the image below the text</span><br><span>- Then show the builder below when opened</span><br><span>- Do not squeeze the image into a narrow column</span><br><span>- Keep image height around 240–300px on mobile</span><br><span>- Keep the layout clean and not crowded</span><br><br><span>TASK 5 — Final visual direction</span><br><br><span>The final result should feel:</span><br><span>- premium</span><br><span>- Seoul-based</span><br><span>- beauty-focused</span><br><span>- modern</span><br><span>- calm</span><br><span>- editorial</span><br><span>- less empty</span><br><span>- more polished</span><br><br><span>Do not make the section look like a travel agency banner.</span><br><span>Do not add text overlays on the image.</span><br><span>Do not add extra buttons.</span><br><span>Do not add filters unless needed very subtly.</span><br><br><span>TASK 6 — Final confirmation</span><br><br><span>After editing, confirm:</span><br><span>1. all-in-one-hero.png is used in the All-in-One Package card</span><br><span>2. The image appears on the right side on desktop</span><br><span>3. The package text remains on the left side</span><br><span>4. The empty right space is gone</span><br><span>5. The Build Your Journey button still works</span><br><span>6. The builder still opens correctly</span><br><span>7. Selection validation still works</span><br><span>8. Total price calculation still works</span><br><span>9. Mobile layout stacks cleanly</span><br><span>10. No unrelated pages were changed</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="4125" data-end="4188">만약 이미지가 안 뜨면 거의 100% 파일 경로 문제야. 그때는 Claude Code에 이렇게 추가로 말하면 돼.</p>
