ight))] scroll-mt-(--header-height)" dir="auto" data-turn-id="a5197cd2-7896-4d5a-a249-d444b30b29e0" data-turn-id-container="a5197cd2-7896-4d5a-a249-d444b30b29e0" data-testid="conversation-turn-211" data-scroll-anchor="false" data-turn="user"><h4 class="sr-only select-none">나의 말:</h4><div class="text-base my-auto mx-auto pt-12 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)"><div class="[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow"><div data-message-author-role="user" data-message-id="a5197cd2-7896-4d5a-a249-d444b30b29e0" dir="auto" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden items-end rtl:items-start"><div class="user-message-bubble-color corner-superellipse/0.98 relative min-w-0 overflow-hidden rounded-[22px] px-4 py-2.5 leading-6 max-w-(--user-chat-width,70%)"><div class="max-w-full min-w-0 [overflow-wrap:anywhere] whitespace-pre-wrap">이미지 생성은 좋아. 이거 1초씩 carousel 처럼 넘어가게 해줄 수 있어?</div></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex justify-end"><div aria-label="내 메시지 작업" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto touch:opacity-100 duration-300 group-hover/turn-messages:delay-300 pointer-events-none opacity-0 motion-safe:transition-opacity group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:opacity-100 group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:opacity-100 has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:opacity-100" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="메시지 복사" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-bc53276c.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="메시지 편집" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-bc53276c.svg#6d87e1" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button></div></div></div></div><span class="sr-only"><br></span></section></div><div class="" data-turn-id-container="request-69c3afa5-a280-83ab-9a2c-f2daa157c33c-0" data-is-intersecting="true"><section class="text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]" dir="auto" data-turn-id="request-69c3afa5-a280-83ab-9a2c-f2daa157c33c-0" data-turn-id-container="request-69c3afa5-a280-83ab-9a2c-f2daa157c33c-0" data-testid="conversation-turn-212" data-scroll-anchor="false" data-turn="assistant"><h4 class="sr-only select-none">ChatGPT의 말:</h4><div class="text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)"><div class="[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><button type="button" class="text-token-text-tertiary hover:text-token-text-primary dark:hover:text-token-text-primary flex items-center gap-0.5 text-start dark:text-(--interactive-label-tertiary-default)">15s 동안 생각함<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="icon-xs"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-bc53276c.svg#b140e7" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="8faf4698-210a-49d6-82e4-61bd6fff9e1c" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-5-thinking" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1" data-turn-start-message="true" tabindex="0"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="134">응, 가능해. <strong data-start="8" data-end="87">영상 파일로 이어붙이는 것보다, 웹페이지 안에서 1초마다 자동 전환되는 이미지 carousel/slideshow로 넣는 게 훨씬 좋아.</strong><br data-start="87" data-end="90">
속도도 빠르고, 용량도 작고, Codex/Claude Code로 구현하기 쉬워.</p>
<p data-start="136" data-end="173">먼저 방금 생성한 이미지들을 GitHub에 아래 이름으로 저장해줘.</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="175" data-end="254"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button type="button" class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="복사" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-bc53276c.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>hero-slide-1.png</span><br><span>hero-slide-2.png</span><br><span>hero-slide-3.png</span><br><span>hero-slide-4.png</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="256" data-end="297">그리고 Claude Code / Codex에는 아래 프롬프트를 넣으면 돼.</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="299" data-end="4683"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button type="button" class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="복사" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-bc53276c.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>Please add an automatic image carousel to the Home page All-in-One Package hero section.</span><br><br><span>Important:</span><br><span>- Only edit the Home page All-in-One Package hero section and related CSS/JS</span><br><span>- Do not redesign the whole website</span><br><span>- Do not modify navigation, language switcher, cart, Programs, Consultation, About, FAQ, Contact, footer, or unrelated sections</span><br><span>- Do not change All-in-One builder functionality</span><br><span>- Do not change pricing logic</span><br><span>- Do not change validation logic</span><br><span>- Keep the current premium, minimal, editorial visual style</span><br><br><span>Goal:</span><br><span>Add a premium image carousel to the right side of the All-in-One Package card.</span><br><br><span>The carousel should automatically change images every 1 second.</span><br><br><span>Use these image files from the repository root:</span><br><br><span>hero-slide-1.png</span><br><span>hero-slide-2.png</span><br><span>hero-slide-3.png</span><br><span>hero-slide-4.png</span><br><br><span>TASK 1 — Add carousel to the right side of the All-in-One Package card</span><br><br><span>Inside the Home page All-in-One Package hero card, create a two-column desktop layout.</span><br><br><span>Left column:</span><br><span>- SIGNATURE ITINERARY</span><br><span>- All-in-One Package</span><br><span>- Starting from $1,499</span><br><span>- Description</span><br><span>- Included line</span><br><span>- Build Your Journey button</span><br><br><span>Right column:</span><br><span>- Image carousel using the 4 images above</span><br><br><span>The carousel should sit inside the same large All-in-One Package card on the right side.</span><br><br><span>TASK 2 — Carousel behavior</span><br><br><span>Carousel requirements:</span><br><span>- Automatically transition to the next image every 1 second</span><br><span>- Loop infinitely</span><br><span>- Use a smooth fade transition</span><br><span>- No arrows needed</span><br><span>- No dots needed</span><br><span>- No text overlay</span><br><span>- No play/pause button needed</span><br><span>- The carousel should feel subtle and premium, not flashy</span><br><br><span>Preferred behavior:</span><br><span>- Each slide stays visible for 1 second</span><br><span>- Fade transition duration should be around 500ms</span><br><span>- After the last image, loop back to the first image</span><br><br><span>TASK 3 — Image styling</span><br><br><span>Image requirements:</span><br><span>- width: 100%</span><br><span>- height: 100%</span><br><span>- object-fit: cover</span><br><span>- display: block</span><br><span>- border-radius should match the current card design</span><br><span>- image should not stretch or distort</span><br><span>- image should not overflow outside the card</span><br><span>- image crop should feel editorial and premium</span><br><br><span>Suggested CSS direction:</span><br><span>.all-in-one-hero {</span><br><span>  display: grid;</span><br><span>  grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.9fr) minmax(0, 1.1fr);</span><br><span>  gap: 40px;</span><br><span>  align-items: stretch;</span><br><span>}</span><br><br><span>.all-in-one-carousel {</span><br><span>  position: relative;</span><br><span>  min-height: 360px;</span><br><span>  border-radius: 24px;</span><br><span>  overflow: hidden;</span><br><span>}</span><br><br><span>.all-in-one-carousel img {</span><br><span>  position: absolute;</span><br><span>  inset: 0;</span><br><span>  width: 100%;</span><br><span>  height: 100%;</span><br><span>  object-fit: cover;</span><br><span>  opacity: 0;</span><br><span>  transition: opacity 500ms ease;</span><br><span>}</span><br><br><span>.all-in-one-carousel img.is-active {</span><br><span>  opacity: 1;</span><br><span>}</span><br><br><span>TASK 4 — JavaScript behavior</span><br><br><span>Add lightweight JavaScript to rotate the active slide.</span><br><br><span>Suggested logic:</span><br><span>- Select all images inside the All-in-One carousel</span><br><span>- Start with the first image active</span><br><span>- Every 1000ms, remove active class from current image and add it to the next image</span><br><span>- Loop back to image 0 after the final image</span><br><span>- Do not run the carousel script if the carousel does not exist on the page</span><br><br><span>TASK 5 — Preserve builder</span><br><br><span>If the builder currently appears under the package card, keep it below the two-column hero content.</span><br><br><span>Final layout should be:</span><br><br><span>Top:</span><br><span>[Package text / CTA] [Image carousel]</span><br><br><span>Below after clicking Build Your Journey:</span><br><span>[Builder selection area]</span><br><br><span>Do not break:</span><br><span>- Build Your Journey button</span><br><span>- Builder open/reveal behavior</span><br><span>- Program selection</span><br><span>- Price calculation</span><br><span>- Continue to Consultation</span><br><br><span>TASK 6 — Mobile responsiveness</span><br><br><span>On mobile:</span><br><span>- Stack the package text first</span><br><span>- Then show the carousel below the text</span><br><span>- Then show the builder below when opened</span><br><span>- Carousel height should be around 240–300px</span><br><span>- Keep the image full width</span><br><span>- Do not squeeze the carousel into a narrow column</span><br><br><span>TASK 7 — Accessibility</span><br><br><span>Use alt text for each image:</span><br><span>hero-slide-1.png: Premium Seoul beauty spa with Namsan view</span><br><span>hero-slide-2.png: Luxury K-beauty concierge boutique with city view</span><br><span>hero-slide-3.png: Serene Seoul spa room with sunset view</span><br><span>hero-slide-4.png: Elegant Seoul beauty salon with Han River view</span><br><br><span>TASK 8 — Final confirmation</span><br><br><span>After editing, confirm:</span><br><span>1. The carousel appears on the right side of the All-in-One Package card</span><br><span>2. It uses hero-slide-1.png through hero-slide-4.png</span><br><span>3. Images change automatically every 1 second</span><br><span>4. Carousel loops infinitely</span><br><span>5. Fade transition is smooth</span><br><span>6. Images are not stretched or distorted</span><br><span>7. Build Your Journey button still works</span><br><span>8. Builder selection still works</span><br><span>9. Total price calculation still works</span><br><span>10. Mobile layout stacks cleanly</span><br><span>11. No unrelated pages were changed</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="4685" data-end="4720">추가로 이미지가 안 뜨면 경로 문제라서 이 문장을 같이 붙여줘.</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="4722" data-end="4913"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button type="button" class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="복사" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-bc53276c.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>The images are uploaded in the repository root folder. Use hero-slide-1.png, hero-slide-2.png, hero-slide-3.png, and hero-slide-4.png directly. Do not use images/hero-slide-1.png.</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="4915" data-end="5034" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">추천은 <strong data-start="4919" data-end="4940">1초 전환 + 0.5초 fade</strong>야. 너무 빠르게 번쩍이면 고급스러운 느낌이 깨지니까, 실제로 봤을 때 정신없으면 <code data-start="4986" data-end="4994">1000ms</code>를 <code data-start="4996" data-end="5004">1800ms</code>나 <code data-start="5006" data-end="5014">2500ms</code>로 늘리는 게 더 프리미엄하게 보여.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="응답 작업" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="응답 복사" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-bc53276c.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="좋은 응답" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="good-response-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria