 do those details tell the story?\",\"starter_prompt\":\"What is the 40th Street Fair in Midtown Manhattan, and what should I expect there?\",\"developer_instructions\":\"The user clicked a ChatGPT homepage doodle. Do not ask them to upload or show the doodle. Concisely explain the event behind the doodle with concrete details: what date \u0026 time the event is in bold, who it centers on or brings together, what the event is, where it happens, why it matters, and how the doodle's visual details connect to that story. Keep the event explanation to at most 1-2 short paragraphs. Make sure you use the right tense for when the event is happening. Use the map widget to ground your answer in the doodle's New York City context. If you can identify the most relevant venue, neighborhood, or event location, include it on the map while you explain the doodle. Answer the user's visible prompt using this doodle context:\",\"oled_image_url\":\"https://persistent.oaistatic.com/chatgpt/doodles/2026-05-19-to-2026-05-24-blossom-carson-prompt/festivals/2026-05-20/new-york-festivals/01-new-york-festivals-doodle-linework-integration-oled.png\",\"light_image_url\":\"https://persistent.oaistatic.com/chatgpt/doodles/2026-05-19-to-2026-05-24-blossom-carson-prompt/festivals/2026-05-20/new-york-festivals/01-new-york-festivals-doodle-linework-integration-light.png\",\"dark_image_url\":\"https://persistent.oaistatic.com/chatgpt/doodles/2026-05-19-to-2026-05-24-blossom-carson-prompt/festivals/2026-05-20/new-york-festivals/01-new-york-festivals-doodle-linework-integration-dark.png\"},\"sf\":{\"developer_instructions\":\"The user clicked a ChatGPT homepage doodle. Do not ask them to upload or show the doodle. Concisely explain the event behind the doodle with concrete details: what date \u0026 time the event is in bold, who it centers on or brings together, what the event is, where it happens, why it matters, and how the doodle's visual details connect to that story. Keep the event explanation to 